OL,3,A'Superhero' boy, 9, with amputated foot
OL,4,Acompletes Three Peaks Challenge in
OL,5,Aunder 24 hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nine-year-old boy who had his foot
OL,8,Famputated as a toddler hopes he has
OL,9,Fbecome the youngest amputee to complete
OL,10,Fthe tallest peaks in Wales, Scotland
OL,11,Fand England in less than 24 hours.
OL,13,FAlbie-Junior Thomas finished the Three
OL,14,FPeaks Challenge in 22 hours and 30
OL,15,Fminutes alongside his dad, powered by
OL,16,Fham and cheese sandwiches, sour sweets
OL,17,Fand four months' training.
OL,19,FThe youngster from Hollywell,
OL,20,FFlintshire, was born without a fibula
OL,21,Fin his left leg and his foot was
OL,22,Fremoved at 15 months.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
