OL,3,A'Superhero' boy, 9, with amputated foot
OL,4,Acompletes Three Peaks Challenge in
OL,5,Aunder 24 hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite this, at four he became the
OL,8,Fyoungest amputee to scale Yr Wyddfa,
OL,9,Falso known as Snowdon, Wales' highest
OL,10,Fpeak.
